    "updated_at": "2018-01-21T16:51:20Z",
    "body": "This is a bug in Spring then, that it does not know about the connection being closed. We cannot really do anything else than close the connection that's HTTP/1 compatible. I recommend filing a bug against the framework.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
