    "updated_at": "2018-01-22T10:05:46Z",
    "body": "Just in the same way the client \"opens\" a connection, sending \"something\" to the server.\r\nClosing the connection should be something similar.\r\n\r\n( I mean, HTML page or browser, may be one -or both- of them )\r\nIf the client opens the connection, the same client should \"close\" the connection also.",
    "author_association": "NONE",
